-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTICES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Knight of the Bug is a modified version of "Sleeping Beauty", a 7-day
roguelike (7DRL 2017) by Ondřej Žára:

    https://github.com/ondras/sleeping-beauty

The game design, level generation, combat puzzle and much of the code
structure derive from that work. The title screen art, the bug-hunting
theme, the Bug boss, the seeded-bug mode, the test suite and the build
setup are new in this version. A complete account of what was changed is
kept in docs/theme.md.

The original author granted explicit written permission to use, retitle and
modify Sleeping Beauty in this way, by email on 26 October 2021. A copy of
that exchange is kept at assets/permission.png.

Sleeping Beauty was published under the ISC License, reproduced here for the
portions of this work derived from it:

    ISC License

    Copyright (c) 2017 Ondřej Žára

    Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
    purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above
    copyright notice and this permission notice appear in all copies.

    THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND THE AUTHOR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES
    WITH REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF
    MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR
    ANY SPECIAL, DIRECT, INDIRECT, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES
    WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN
    ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT OF
    OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.

The Metrickal typeface (public/fonts/Metrickal-Regular.otf) is by Robey
Pointer and is licensed under the Apache License 2.0, with the author's one
stipulation that a modified typeface may not be released under the name
"Metrickal". It is used here unmodified. The original repository
(github.com/robey/metrickal-typeface) is no longer available; a copy survives
at https://github.com/davelab6/metrickal-typeface.

rot.js, the JavaScript roguelike toolkit used for the map display, field of
view, noise and random numbers, is by Ondřej Žára and is distributed under
the BSD 3-Clause License; see https://github.com/ondras/rot.js.
